From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:48:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 41/47] dt-bindings: mfd: syscon: Add Ingenic X2600 MAC PHY
 control

The CGU of the X2600 holds the register that sets up the Ethernet MAC's
PHY interface; the MAC's glue driver reaches it through a syscon.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
index 945a168b6..3ddd26e85 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
@@ -72,6 +72,7 @@ properties:
               - hisilicon,pcie-sas-subctrl
               - hisilicon,peri-subctrl
               - hpe,gxp-sysreg
+              - ingenic,x2600-mac-phy-ctrl
               - loongson,ls1b-syscon
               - loongson,ls1c-syscon
               - loongson,ls2k0300-chipid-syscon
